§ `ss 8, 10, 21, 22 and Fourth Schedule`

#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered cafe selling coffee` EQUALS `standard-rated`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `an unregistered hawker selling noodles` EQUALS `outside the scope of GST`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered shop giving away free samples` EQUALS `outside the scope of GST`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered shop giving away goods the Second Schedule treats as supplied` EQUALS `standard-rated`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered landlord renting out a flat` EQUALS `exempt`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered landlord renting out a shop` EQUALS `standard-rated`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered trader exporting goods` EQUALS `zero-rated`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered consultant supplying international services` EQUALS `zero-rated`
#ASSERT `How is my supply treated` `a registered trader selling her own car privately` EQUALS `outside the scope of GST`

#ASSERT `Is what I supply exempt` `providing a life insurance contract`

#ASSERT `Must I charge GST on my supply` `a registered cafe selling coffee`

#ASSERT `Is my supply a taxable supply` `a registered trader exporting goods`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my supply a taxable supply` `a registered landlord renting out a flat`

§ `s 11(2)`

#ASSERT `When does my supply take place` (JUST (Date 10 12 2023)) (JUST (Date 5 1 2024)) EQUALS JUST (Date 10 12 2023)
#ASSERT `When does my supply take place` (JUST (Date 3 1 2023)) (JUST (Date 20 12 2022)) EQUALS JUST (Date 20 12 2022)
#ASSERT `When does my supply take place` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

