#ASSERT `What is the GST rate in percent on the day my supply takes place` (Date 1 1 2024) EQUALS JUST 9
#ASSERT `What is the GST rate in percent on the day my supply takes place` (Date 31 12 2023) EQUALS JUST 8
#ASSERT `What is the GST rate in percent on the day my supply takes place` (Date 30 6 2007) EQUALS JUST 5
#ASSERT `What is the GST rate in percent on the day my supply takes place` (Date 31 12 2002) EQUALS NOTHING

