#ASSERT `What is the most I may charge under a contract made before the rate changed` 1070 7 8 TRUE FALSE EQUALS 1070
#ASSERT `What is the most I may charge under a contract made before the rate changed` 1070 7 8 FALSE TRUE EQUALS 1070
#ASSERT `What is the most I may charge under a contract made before the rate changed` 1090 9 8 FALSE FALSE EQUALS 1090

§ `s 19`

#ASSERT `How much of the GST I paid counts as my input tax` 900 60 EQUALS 540

#ASSERT `What do I pay or get back for the period` 5000 3000 EQUALS `I must pay the Comptroller` 2000
#ASSERT `What do I pay or get back for the period` 1000 4000 EQUALS `the Comptroller must pay me` 3000
